{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/extras/logo.gif?t=1729927881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Escape Floor 13</strong>, a tense, atmospheric survival puzzle game where every step could be your last. You find yourself trapped on the mysterious 13th floor of a hotel, and the only way out is down. To reach safety, you must navigate each floor carefully, but beware\u2014supernatural anomalies haunt these hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/extras/elevator_close.gif?t=1729927881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is simple: cross each floor and reach the elevator on the other side. But if you sense an anomaly, you must retreat to the elevator you came from. Will you survive the journey to freedom, or will the 13th floor become your final stop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/extras/mainmenu.gif?t=1729927881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hotel is always watching. Stay alert, trust your instincts, and escape\u2026 before it\u2019s too late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305060?t=1729927881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729927881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/f03002f4fb4a3ce495a135b62f0ed364c682176b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729927881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305060/f03002f4fb4a3ce495a135b62f0ed364c682176b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729927881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":